TI  - H2O: A Foundation Model Bridging Histopathology to Spatial Multi-Omics Profiling
AU  - Gu, Yunjie
AU  - Wu, Zihan
AU  - Yan, Rui
AU  - Wang, Zhikang
AU  - Li, Yuan
